      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, generating the list should be relatively easy if need be, but admittedly I\u0027m a bit confused as to why it is needed in the first place? For sure you need to embed the vendor symbol list in the kernel, but why would anything else be needed? (I might be missing something obvious here, apologies if that is the case, I\u0027m just trying to see if we can reduce a bit the effort of maintaining an extra list)",
